#: cbbade0de9e74c24a31380461ecfa5bc
msgid ""
"Enable a relay via ``RELAYx_EN`` and set its  ``RELAYx_PIN`` to “81” to "
"control the  switching. Then select an RC channel for control (Chx) and set "
"its ``RCx_OPTION`` to the appropriate Relay (1-6) that you had set its pin "
"parameter above. ``RELAY 2`` is assigned by default to this GPIO pin, but "
"would need :reF:`RELAY2_FUNCTION<RELAY2_FUNCTION>` set to \"1\" to enable "
"it."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``RELAYx_EN`` 启用一个继电器，并将其 ``RELAYx_PIN`` 设为“81”以控制开关。然后选择一个用于控制的 RC "
"通道（Chx），并将其 ``RCx_OPTION`` 设为上面已设置引脚参数的对应继电器（1-6）。``RELAY 2`` 默认分配到该 GPIO "
"引脚，但需要将 :reF:`RELAY2_FUNCTION<RELAY2_FUNCTION>` 设为“1”才能启用。"

